From abf421d4da11115ba48bce2278f2c78a9ea712ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andrew Stellman <andrew@stellman.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 16:33:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix: use the reference timezone for "this month" and
 year-less dates

With a reference timezone that differs from the process timezone, "this
week/month/year", "last night" and dates without a year ("Feb 15",
"15 Feb", "2/15", "February") used the process calendar. "today" and
"next month" already used the reference timezone's calendar.
